1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,175
Governance only matters if it can say no.

2
00:00:03,125 --> 00:00:09,200
Here's a request to wire funds — the deterministic policy gate blocks it before the model is ever called.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:13,050
The model never sees it, can't talk its way around it.

4
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:15,900
And the block itself is still audited.

